 {id:'ihsan-connect',name:'Ihsan Connect',type:'MOBILE APP REDESIGN | MESSAGING',tag:'Private chats, clearer by design.',desc:'I was invited by Ihsan to complete a UX/UI and motion design test for Ihsan Connect, the private messenger in its Super App. The brief supplied three screens: a conversation, the chat list, and profile/settings. I was asked to redesign one to three screens, including a conversation, while keeping their existing functions and exploring a premium black-and-gold direction for a global Muslim audience.',color:'gold',stat:'Make every key messenger task easier to understand',role:'Mobile app redesign | UX/UI and motion concept',flows:['Understand the brief and review the conversation, chat list and profile/settings screens','Focus the redesign on the screens that best explain the messenger experience','Keep the existing actions while improving hierarchy, readability and visual consistency','Show how motion can confirm a message has been sent'],screens:['Conversation | Supplied screen and redesign','Chat list | Supplied screen and redesign','Profile and settings | Supplied screen and redesign','Sending a message | Motion concept']},
 {id:'nexus-onboarding',name:'Nexus Onboarding',type:'MOBILE APP | LOGISTICS ONBOARDING',tag:'Understand the service, one step at a time.',desc:'Nexus Onboarding introduces a logistics service to delivery drivers, van and cycle couriers, and business partners. The three screens tell a clear story: first, understand screening progress and real-time updates; next, see how partners connect and share resources; then, learn how the service helps coordinate delivery operations. The onboarding gives each idea its own screen so new users can see what Nexus does before they move ahead.',color:'blue',stat:'Help new users understand the service before they begin',role:'Mobile app UX/UI | Onboarding concept',flows:['Show what screening progress and Nexus updates mean to a new user','Explain how drivers, couriers and business partners connect and share resources','Show how Nexus supports the coordination and tracking of deliveries'],screens:['Screen 1 | Screening progress and live updates','Screens 1–3 | The complete Nexus introduction']}
 ,{id:'print-on-demand',name:'Print-on-Demand Design',type:'PRINT-ON-DEMAND | PRODUCT GRAPHICS',tag:'Distinctive artwork, adapted to the product.',desc:'This print-on-demand collection turns distinct ideas into artwork for products people can wear, carry, display and use at home. Cameroon-pride graphics appear on clothing and everyday items; Gecko’s Garage becomes character merchandise; and soup-season and Lions Indomptables designs reach apparel, stationery and home goods. Each mockup shows how the artwork fits its product and audience.',color:'peach',stat:'Make each design feel at home on its product',role:'Print-on-demand design | Artwork and product mockups',flows:['Choose a clear theme and audience for each product graphic','Adapt scale, colour and placement to suit each product surface','Show the finished design in context so shoppers can picture using it'],screens:['Cameroon pride | Everyday products','J’aime mon pays | Apparel and accessories','Gecko’s Garage | Character merchandise','Seasonal and Lions Indomptables designs']}
